          </COMPARAM-REF>
          <COMPARAM-REF ID-REF="ISO_15765_3.CP_TesterPresentExpPosResp" DOCREF="ISO_15765_3" DOCTYPE="COMPARAM-SUBSET">
            <SIMPLE-VALUE>7E00</SIMPLE-VALUE>
            <DESC TI="E14FB485CA69457fB677DD8EEF458124">
              <p>Define the expected ECU positive response to a Tester Present Message.

Type: PDU_PT_BYTEFIELD 
